y amend­\ned, effective as of April 1, 1942, by in­\nserting therein, between the designation \nof the countries of Rumania and Spain, \nthe folldwing-designated country, mone­\ntary unit, and basic rate:\nSaudi Arabia _____Rial ____35.74\nF ranklin  D  Roosevelt\nT he W hi","path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/texts/EO_9261.txt","sha256":"17d26ab85a2889d2db0384399f14df9018d31dc224f6e0be673ed13949ffbbf3","source":{"line":249,"path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"027e8141f622964b4cb214bcc38bd987cf66870c8d671151ebed2644d50b3c34"}}]}
